<p>A kitchen doesn't always need to be gutted to feel new. New cabinet doors, a better countertop, a backsplash and some well-placed storage can change how a kitchen looks and works for far less disruption than starting from scratch. We remodel kitchens with a carpenter's focus on fit and finish. Zanini Renovations has been a fully insured renovation business in Carleton Place since 2020, serving Lanark County and Ottawa.</p>

